Date: 2026-08-20

## 0. Verdict, stated plainly

**The Jaffe–Witten four-dimensional quantum Yang–Mills existence and mass-gap
theorem is not closed in this repository, and it was not closed by this work.**

No claim of closure is made anywhere below. Nothing in this report, and nothing
